                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-01"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1, 1900</hi></date>
                        (via Taku, October 5).</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger acknowledges receipt on September 30 of Department’s telegram of
                    September 22 communicating replies to Chinese, Russian, and German
                    Governments.)</p>
            </div>
